{"id":"n49247-1-3","stage":4,"title":"소위 · 所谓","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49247-1-3-1","ko":"대학까지 나온 사람이 예의가 너무 없어요.","zh":"一个读过大学的人，礼貌程度也太低了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대학까지","meaning":"大学","explanation":"대학：大学；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"대학","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61281","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나온","meaning":"结业，毕业","explanation":"나오다：结业，毕业；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"25","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"3","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예의가","meaning":"礼仪，礼节，礼貌","explanation":"예의：礼仪，礼节，礼貌；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"예의","audio":"/audio/886100242a964457d096.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14184","senseId":"1","lemma":"예의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a5aac0eac3be8a95","term":"대학","zh":"大学","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3","entryId":"61281","definition":"高中毕业后进入的高等教育机构。","pronunciation":["대ː학"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"结业，毕业","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"结束教育机关内一定的教育课程，完成学业。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"具备一定的资格或人格的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"886100242a964457","term":"예의","zh":"礼仪，礼节，礼貌","audio":"/audio/886100242a964457d096.mp3","entryId":"14184","definition":"如恭敬的语气或正直的行动一样，人在社会生活中应该遵守的东西。","pronunciation":["예의","예이"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/14b1fb1be5cca446d943.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49247-1-3-2","ko":"소위 배웠다는 사람이 그러면 안 되지.","zh":"号称受过教育的人，可不能这样啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소위","meaning":"所谓","explanation":"소위：所谓","readings":[{"term":"소위","audio":"/audio/605a68866b5018cca6e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49247","senseId":"1","lemma":"소위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배웠다는","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"3","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러면","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되지.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"605a68866b5018cc","term":"소위","zh":"所谓","audio":"/audio/605a68866b5018cca6e8.mp3","entryId":"49247","definition":"如人们常说的那样。","pronunciation":["소ː위"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"具备一定的资格或人格的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/129c378fe0e7804a1580.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49247","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["号称受过教育的人，可不能这样啊。","我本来以为这次考试我一定能通过的。","一个读过大学的人，礼貌程度也太低了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["号称受过教育的人，可不能这样啊。","一个读过大学的人，礼貌程度也太低了。","我本来以为这次考试我一定能通过的。"],"answer":0}]}
